      "created_at": "2019-03-12T22:40:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would just like to point out that \"bug\"&nbsp;<em>is</em>&nbsp;a scientific word, referring specifically to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hemiptera\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">true bugs</a>. Just so we're all on the same page.</p>\n<p>I wonder what bugs in the system caused the extreme delay on publication. :B Not that I'm complaining. I wanted to get a walk in today, listening to the LP is the perfect thing to do while walking, and if it had come out at its usual time, it would have been too cold outside! XD</p>",
